Optional Windows website viewer (DEEP 2.1)
----------------------------------------
Microsoft.Web.WebView2 SDK 1.0.4258.31:
https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.Web.WebView2/1.0.4258.31
The portable viewer includes the SDK's LICENSE and NOTICE in bin/viewer/licenses.
The separately installed Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime is governed by
Microsoft's runtime terms and receives its own updates.

The self-contained .NET 10 and Windows Desktop runtimes retain their Microsoft
MIT license and third-party notices in bin/viewer/licenses. The build script
copies notices from the exact restored runtime packages. Runtime versions are
recorded in bin/viewer/DEEP.Viewer.runtimeconfig.json.
Source: https://github.com/dotnet/runtime and https://github.com/dotnet/winforms

The sample site's HTML, CSS, JavaScript and SVG are original DEEP project
content under Apache-2.0. Test fonts are read temporarily from the local Windows
installation; they are not part of the distribution.
